            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Create a tag. An account cannot have more than **500** unique tags.\n\nA tag belongs to a single tag group. If `relationships.tag-group.data.id` is not specified,\nthe tag is added to the account's default tag group.<br><br>*Rate limits*:<br>Burst: `3/s`<br>Steady: `60/m`\n\n**Scopes:**\n`tags:read`\n`tags:write`"
        },
